5,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting! I wonder who the scary werewolf is? Let's all be honest, okay?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Let's keep a calm head. We need to observe each other's patterns carefully before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Victoria. Logic and observation are our best tools here. Let's see how everyone behaves.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Such a noisy start. I'll just be watching you all from the sidelines for now. Try not to be too obvious.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, why are you being so quiet? Are you hiding a big secret? Tell us something!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Rin, pushing people too hard this early might not be productive. Let's give everyone time to settle in.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. Pressure can lead to false positives. I'm more interested in who tries to deflect the conversation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I am simply observing. There is no need to rush into accusations on day zero.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"How boring. You're all playing the ""cautious"" card. I wonder who's actually terrified of being found out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not terrified! I'm just curious! I want to find the werewolf and be the hero of the village!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Heroism is a dangerous motivation in this game. We should focus on survival and accuracy instead.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Victoria is right. We need a systematic approach. I'll be paying close attention to the contradictions in your stories.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"A systematic approach is wise. However, remember that the Possessed can mimic a Villager perfectly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio finally speaks with some substance. Though, pointing out the Possessed is a classic way to shift suspicion.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,This is like a real mystery novel! I can't wait for tomorrow to see if anyone knows anything!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"Let's hope the Seer finds something useful tonight. Until then, I'll be watching.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll do my part. Let's all try to get some rest and stay sharp for the first vote tomorrow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
