31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Good morning! Did anyone have any spooky dreams? Or maybe the Seer found a big clue!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,It's too early for the Seer to reveal everything. We should listen to see if anyone slips up first.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I have some information, but revealing it too early makes me a target for the werewolf. I'll wait.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, if you are the Seer, withholding information can be as dangerous as revealing it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki is playing a very predictable game. The ""I have a secret"" act is a bit cliché, don't you think?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, please tell us! I'm too curious to wait! Is someone a werewolf? Is it Shion?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Rin, your impulsiveness is making it hard to analyze the actual flow of the conversation. Please slow down.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I can tell you that Shion is human. I've confirmed it. Now, let's see how the others react to this.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Shion is human, then the werewolf is among the remaining four. That narrows the field slightly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'm human? Well, the Seer has good taste. But @Mizuki, you've just put a target on your back.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! Shion is safe! That means it's one of us! Maybe it's Toshio? He's still being too serious!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"Being serious isn't a crime, Rin. However, @Mizuki, by claiming Seer, you've shifted the game's dynamic.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,That was my intention. I want to see who tries to discredit me or who suddenly agrees with me too eagerly.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin's accusations are baseless. @Mizuki, who else have you considered divining? Or who do you suspect?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I suspect the one who is trying too hard to lead the logic. @Mizuki, your ""systematic approach"" feels a bit forced.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,I think we should vote for Toshio! He's too quiet and then suddenly too smart! It's suspicious!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"I'm not convinced by Rin's logic, but @Mizuki's sudden reveal is a bold move. I'll trust the divination for now.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll stand by my result. Shion is human. As for the vote, I suspect Toshio's deflective nature.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I am a Villager. Voting me out based on ""vibes"" is a mistake the village cannot afford.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,This is amusing. I'll go with the flow for now. Let's see if Toshio can talk his way out of this.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
