64,2,1,talk,Rin,,Oh no! Toshio is gone and now Mizuki is gone too! This is getting really scary!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The werewolf attacked the Seer. That was a calculated move to eliminate our source of information.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Shion,,Predictable. The werewolf knew Mizuki was the Seer the moment she spoke. Now we're left in the dark.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Who could it be? Victoria? Shion? I'm just a little girl, I can't be the werewolf!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, your panic is understandable, but we must be rational. Shion was confirmed human by Mizuki.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Indeed. That leaves you and Victoria. And since I'm the only one with a ""certified"" human status...","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Rin,,"But that's not fair! Just because I'm energetic doesn't mean I'm a wolf! @Victoria, help me!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am trying to help, Rin. But logically, if Shion is human and Mizuki is dead, the wolf is either you or me.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. And between a panicked girl and a calm woman, the wolf usually hides behind the mask of ""reason.""","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Rin,,@Shion is being mean! I'm not the wolf! I'll vote for Victoria because she's too quiet!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"If you vote for me and I'm human, the werewolf wins. Think carefully, Rin.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Shion,,I've thought enough. The pattern is clear. I'll make the final decision.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
